  - PRINTED 174 IS A COLUMN-WELDED PAGE in the OCR cache: the entry''s own two
    columns interleave line by line, so the equipment paragraph reads through
    the middle of the skill list. Every field here was separated by following
    each column''s own sentences rather than by reading down the page.
  - "Pilot Robots & Power Armor" is printed with a dash and no percentage where
    every other skill in the list carries one. Read as the skill granted at its
    catalog base with no bonus, not as a missing number: the entry grants two
    Robot Combat Elite lines immediately after it, so the piloting skill is
    clearly intended.
